      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Manager & Lead DevOps Engineer ·  <a href="https://yalim.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YaLIM LLC</a></h2>
        <p class="card-meta">Fairfax, Virginia · 2022 — Present</p>
        <p class="card-meta">
          Leading the design and operation of Talos-based Kubernetes clusters and CI/CD pipelines for YaLIM
          Cloud, hosting multiple DHIS2-based national health information systems and disease surveillance
          platforms.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Board Director ·  <a href="https://hispci.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">HISP Côte d'Ivoire</a></h2>
