        <p class="card-meta">Arlington, VA · 2019 — 2025</p>
        <p class="card-meta">
          Led DHIS2 and developer teams for JSI projects, guiding national HIS implementations, security
          assessments, and data use initiatives across multiple countries.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
